Hope we're running
the right fucking way.

524
00:39:48.028 --> 00:39:49.395
Just keep running.

525
00:39:53.700 --> 00:39:54.801
What the fuck?!

526
00:39:54.901 --> 00:39:56.970
Return to base.

527
00:39:57.070 --> 00:40:00.406
Soldier. return to base.

528
00:40:01.574 --> 00:40:03.043
Run!

529
00:40:21.862 --> 00:40:23.329
Never seen that shit.

530
00:40:23.396 --> 00:40:26.933
Pop more smoke! More smoke!
Blind those fucking things!

531
00:40:50.924 --> 00:40:53.960
Keep going! Come on!

532
00:40:58.698 --> 00:41:00.266
Last man!

533
00:41:15.615 --> 00:41:17.550
Move. Move.

534
00:41:22.956 --> 00:41:24.958
Move. go. go. go. go. go. go!

535
00:41:25.091 --> 00:41:27.293
- Go. go. go. go. go!
- Go. go. go. go. go.

536
00:41:28.829 --> 00:41:32.632
Come on. go. go. go. go. go!
Go. go. go. go. go!

537
00:42:00.093 --> 00:42:01.427
CIA PID?

538
00:42:01.527 --> 00:42:02.929
I confirmed.

539
00:42:24.184 --> 00:42:28.221
Son of a bitch! Goddamn it!

540
00:42:30.891 --> 00:42:33.026
Go smooth?

541
00:42:33.826 --> 00:42:35.862
As smooth as these things go.

542
00:42:35.962 --> 00:42:37.397
You got a lot of blood
on your face there.

543
00:42:37.497 --> 00:42:38.731
Yeah. that's not mine.

544
00:42:38.865 --> 00:42:40.533
We debriefing?

545
00:42:40.633 --> 00:42:41.902
No. fuck no.
Not here. we're not.

546
00:42:42.035 --> 00:42:43.203
We're getting
the fuck out of here.

547
00:42:43.336 --> 00:42:45.238
Have everyone
ready to move. 1800.

548
00:42:49.809 --> 00:42:53.579
Hey. brother. You got to get her
ready to travel. too.

549
00:42:53.679 --> 00:42:56.249
- Those motherfuckers.
- No.

550
00:42:56.382 --> 00:42:58.718
Get her ready to travel.

551
00:43:03.489 --> 00:43:05.591
Them handlers is
a different breed. aren't they?

552
00:43:05.691 --> 00:43:08.394
They're all a different breed.

553
00:43:09.362 --> 00:43:11.531
All right. let's police up
all this shit.

554
00:43:11.631 --> 00:43:13.233
Let's get the fuck out of here.

555
00:43:13.333 --> 00:43:17.237
Uh. exactly how are we
gonna do that. boss?

556
00:43:36.289 --> 00:43:38.691
That was pretty fucking nutty
right there.

557
00:43:38.758 --> 00:43:41.794
We just killed a bunch of people
for a chess piece

558
00:43:41.928 --> 00:43:45.765
in a war that has nothing
to do with us.

559
00:43:45.898 --> 00:43:47.200
Got something to do with us.

560
00:43:47.300 --> 00:43:49.169
They got SF and CIA
all over the place.

561
00:43:49.269 --> 00:43:51.637
That's what I'm trying
to wrap my head around.

562
00:43:52.538 --> 00:43:54.774
It's not the place
to talk about it.

563
00:43:56.642 --> 00:43:58.178
Where you going?

564
00:43:59.479 --> 00:44:01.181
I have no fucking idea.

565
00:44:01.281 --> 00:44:02.482
Do they have a place for us?

566
00:44:02.582 --> 00:44:05.851
Across the hall. they said.

567
00:44:11.291 --> 00:44:14.927
Seen a lot of crazy shit. boss.
What the hell?

568
00:44:15.028 --> 00:44:16.596
Not here. Bobby.

569
00:44:16.662 --> 00:44:19.065
Fucking robots and drones
and shit.

570
00:44:19.132 --> 00:44:20.800
Not here.

571
00:44:22.635 --> 00:44:23.836
Do we have an exfil?

572
00:44:23.970 --> 00:44:27.740
Same way we came in.
just backwards.

573
00:45:18.191 --> 00:45:19.892
- Hey. you're home.
- I am.

574
00:45:19.992 --> 00:45:22.362
- What time is it?
- It's late.

575
00:45:22.462 --> 00:45:26.532
Or... early.
depending on your perspective.

576
00:45:26.666 --> 00:45:28.734
- Okay.
- No. No. no. no.

577
00:45:28.834 --> 00:45:31.904
Don't get up. I just wanted
to see your face.

578
00:45:32.038 --> 00:45:33.506
- I'll be up in a minute.
- Okay.

579
00:45:33.573 --> 00:45:35.708
- Mm. Love you.
- Bye.

580
00:46:24.757 --> 00:46:26.058
Can I help you?

581
00:46:26.159 --> 00:46:27.360
We're with state police.

582
00:46:27.460 --> 00:46:28.828
Would you mind
stepping outside with us?

583
00:46:28.928 --> 00:46:30.596
I would mind very much.
What is this about?

584
00:46:30.696 --> 00:46:33.599
Please. step outside.

585
00:46:34.434 --> 00:46:35.535
What is this about?

586
00:46:35.601 --> 00:46:38.037
We need you to step outside.

587
00:46:38.138 --> 00:46:39.572
Yeah. I'm gonna need your name.

588
00:46:39.639 --> 00:46:40.806
your badge number.
your fucking watch commander.

589
00:46:40.906 --> 00:46:42.442
a warrant. and all sorts of shit

590
00:46:42.542 --> 00:46:44.710
I don't think
either of you assholes have.

591
00:46:44.810 --> 00:46:47.813
Please. Ma'am.

592
00:46:48.814 --> 00:46:50.416
Outside.

593
00:46:51.251 --> 00:46:52.752
You're not the police.

594
00:46:52.818 --> 00:46:54.620
but you're two minutes
from meeting them.

595
00:47:14.140 --> 00:47:16.075
Oh. fuck.

596
00:47:20.446 --> 00:47:23.082
I need FBI to my house
right now. I'm blown.

597
00:47:23.149 --> 00:47:24.650
and I have two down.
